cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FactorTail
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the library and the
  accompanying manuscript.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: O.
    family-names: Shams Solari
  - given-names: F.
    family-names: Pourbabaee
repository-code: "https://github.com/osolari/FactorTail"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of conditional Monte Carlo estimators for
  multivariate heavy tails — exact sum-tail identities under arbitrary
  dependence, latent-shock and spectral specializations, hidden-cone
  diagnostics, and rolling VaR/ES forecasting.
keywords:
  - rare-event simulation
  - conditional Monte Carlo
  - regular variation
  - factor models
  - tail risk
license: MIT
